  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building National Consensus for Asian Elephants Conservation in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to, (1) ensure that conservation efforts for the Asian elephant in Cambodia are enhanced through the development of a National Action Plan, (2) evaluate distribution and intensity of human-elephant conflict (HEC) in Cambodia and the effectiveness of mitigation methods, and, (3) reduce HEC and enhance and strengthen local management of HEC.</narrative>
  </description>
